## 10. Session-start checklist

1. Read this file (`.clinerules`).
2. Read `.claude/context/current-state.md` + `plan/REGISTRY.md` (read-only).
3. Read `CLAUDE.md` + `docs/adr/ADR-000-index.md`, then only the relevant ADRs.
4. Confirm scope with the user before writing code for a new feature (Plan → approve → Execute).
5. Verify multi-tenancy, add tests, and run `dotnet test` before declaring done.
6. Never modify `.claude/`, `CLAUDE.md`, the ADRs, `plan/REGISTRY.md`, or migration files.

